msgstr "indecap-aprende · Learn in a way that adapts to you"

#: app/templates/home.html:8
msgid ""
"Plataforma educativa inclusiva que adapta actividades, accesibilidad y "
"apoyos a diferentes formas de aprender. Proyecto de INDECAP."
msgstr ""
"Inclusive educational platform that adapts activities, accessibility and "
"supports to different ways of learning. An INDECAP project."

